OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the Proms
OL,8,     Fincluding music by Schumann plus
OL,9,     Fmusic from Imperial Hall Concerts,
OL,10,     FFussen.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stephen
OL,12,G     Sondheim
OL,13,     F5/5. Donald Macleod reflects back
OL,14,     Fon the life and work of Titan of
OL,15,     FMusical Theatre Stephen Sondheim.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPetroc Trelawny welcomes Sir Bryn
OL,18,     FTerfel to 80A for a chat and a
OL,19,     Flive performance with Marios
OL,20,     FPapadopoulos on piano. Trio Zadig
OL,21,     Fare also live in session.
